WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.309
TO_CHAR converts a typed date or timestamp into
formatted text This

00:00:06.335 --> 00:00:12.535
is useful for reports labels exports and
human-facing displays But

00:00:12.561 --> 00:00:18.180
once you turn a timestamp into arbitrary text
temporal sorting and arithmetic become less direct

00:00:19.915 --> 00:00:24.836
Keep the value typed through analytical processing
and format it near the reporting boundary
